Agent Browser skill

Install:
  Prepare Node/pnpm and Git when missing; copy the named skill using skills CLI. Install the CLI, Chromium and Linux browser dependencies.

Upgrade:
  Refresh only this skill and run the same runtime preparation steps.

Status:
  Report local skill files and CLI version; Chromium readiness is not verified.

Requirements:
  Ubuntu, APT and a regular user with sudo access.

Configuration:
  Source: https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-browser
  Destination: ~/.agents/skills/agent-browser
  An existing Codex copy at $CODEX_HOME/skills/agent-browser becomes a link to this directory.
  CODEX_HOME defaults to ~/.codex.
  First skill backup: ${XDG_STATE_HOME:-$HOME/.local/state}/wsley/backups/.
  Codex authentication is configured separately.
